op=\"ingredients\">&frac12; Cup(s) shortening</li> <li class=\"ingredient\" itemprop=\"ingredients\">2 Teaspoon(s) salt</li> <li class=\"ingredient\" itemprop=\"ingredients\">6 Cup(s) flour</li> <li class=\"ingredient\" itemprop=\"ingredients\">2 egg</li> <li class=\"ingredient\" itemprop=\"ingredients\">4 Tablespoon(s) butter, melted</li> <li class=\"ingredient\" itemprop=\"ingredients\">1 Cup(s) brown sugar</li> <li class=\"ingredient\" itemprop=\"ingredients\">4 Teaspoon(s) cinnamon</li> <li class=\"ingredient\" itemprop=\"ingredients\">1 Cup(s) powdered sugar</li> </ul> <div class=\"ERSClear\"></div> </div> <div class=\"ERSInstructions\"> <div class=\"ERSInstructionsHeader ERSHeading\">Instructions</div> <ol> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Combine yeast and warm water in a small bowl.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">In another large bowl, combine milk, sugar, shortening, and salt. Slowly add 3 cups flour. Beat lightly.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Beat in yeast mixture and egg.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Slowly add flour kneading lightly. Too much kneading will make dough tough. Dough should be very sticky and wet.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Let rise in greased bowl until doubled.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Divide in half. Roll out each dough ball into a large rectangle and cover with butter. Sprinkle generously with brown sugar and cinnamon.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Roll and fold ends under. Cut in &frac12; inch slices and place on rimmed baking sheet.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Cover and let rise for 1 hour.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Preheat oven to 400 and bake for 15 minutes.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Can freeze in foil. Reheat at 300 for 20-25 minutes.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Mix confectioner's sugar and water in a small bowl until the sauce is the consistency you like. Spread on rolls.</li> </ol> <div class=\"ERSClear\"></div> </div> <div class=\"endeasyrecipe\" title=\"style002\" style=\"display: none\">3.5.3226</div> </div><br />\n </p>\n"
